    "raw": "",
    "rendered": "<p>kk+ on ModelMayhem.com I joined this community site called Model Mayhem to hopefully to know some more photographers, stylists and models in the fashion photography industry. Please check me out over there and give me your feedback. I&#8217;ve met a couple cool peeps already. Part of the Photography and Visual Storytelling collection. See also: Embarking [&hellip;]</p>\n",
